{"time": 1757679405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "880949062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "*看向修人犯，摇摇头，“可能是领导吧”"}
{"time": 1757679434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400424935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“安农律师，我真的没有想杀修北海啊，我只是吃了他，但是他不应该死的啊啊啊啊啊”"}
{"time": 1757679481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649389719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“嗯，大概的事情我已经听修黑眼说了。事情一定有蹊跷。”"}
