{"time": 1757679783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114575409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "246376731"}, "sender": {"id": "246376731", "name": "ㅤᅠㅤㅤᅠㅤㅤᅠㅤᅠ"}, "message": "“既然如此，我准备先去调查修黑眼两人”"}
