{"time": 1758700169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277816420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=207504655]“我认为我们被人类社会同化后是不能恢复的”"}
{"time": 1758700287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262067856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“你们应该每周都有聚会吧，上上次你们聚会的时候，修北海有被吃掉过吗？”"}
{"time": 1758700451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256060576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“有啊啊啊啊啊，修北海被吃过，他也吃过修哥特啊啊啊啊啊。不过当时他吃完修哥特好像没有拟态成他的样子，还是自己的头发吼吼吼吼吼吼”"}
{"time": 1758700464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344478036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "修卤蛋答道"}
{"time": 1758700650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541299700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "246376731"}, "sender": {"id": "246376731", "name": "ㅤᅠㅤㅤᅠㅤㅤᅠㅤᅠ"}, "message": "“除此之外呢，他没有别的问题吗，比如说话方式变了”"}
{"time": 1758700775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "592509253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“修北海上周聚会以后也变成那样了啊啊啊啊啊，修哥特好像一个月前就这样了吼吼吼吼”"}
{"time": 1758700908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619679293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "246376731"}, "sender": {"id": "246376731", "name": "ㅤᅠㅤㅤᅠㅤㅤᅠㅤᅠ"}, "message": "“你们，还会经常换拟态的样子？”"}
{"time": 1758701130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590784321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“吃完会变成对方的样子吼吼吼吼，不过我们会自己复原回来哈哈哈哈哈，一般来说都会保留自己的发型吼吼吼吼”"}
{"time": 1758701327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061039283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“你们互相吞噬受伤的程度有多大，修哥特现在的治愈力怎么样”"}
{"time": 1758701505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905653648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我们互相吃受的伤很快就能恢复吼吼吼，大概半个小时就可以啊啊啊啊”"}
{"time": 1758701585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "394171794", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2037978956"}, "sender": {"id": "2037978956", "name": "en"}, "message": "“修哥特，你为什么没有拟态成修北海的样子呢？这不是你们的习惯吗？”"}
{"time": 1758701614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122247941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "（死人怎么说话）"}
